# {{PROJECT_NAME}} knowledge base

This directory is the curated, reviewable memory for the project. It owns durable product intent,
requirements, decisions, architecture, conventions, operations, and the feature-spec index. It is
not a replacement for source code or a transcript of every session.

Start at [[00-INDEX]] and follow the smallest source that owns the question. The separate
`context/` directory holds handoffs, logs, drafts, and history; it is intentionally excluded from
curated graph and ranked retrieval truth. Rules: [[_meta/vault-protocol|Vault protocol]].

## Setup required

Replace the bracketed prompts in the product and roadmap notes before treating them as project
authority. Add new durable facts to their owning note rather than creating parallel summaries.

